          "end": 30.54,
          "en": "but I think it would look quite nice if the amount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.54,
          "end": 33.49,
          "en": "and the date inputs would be next to each other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.49,
          "end": 37.7,
          "en": "because both input fields don't need to be that wide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.7,
          "end": 39.72,
          "en": "And then the description input field can be",
